  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/attack-on-titan-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fattack-on-titan-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"官方網站\"></a></p>\n<h1>簡介</h1>\n<p>源自深受喜愛的動漫／漫畫《進擊的巨人》。享受全面改版的 Minecraft 遊戲介面體驗，收錄令人難忘的調查兵團成員、巨人化者，以及主角兼反角艾倫·耶格爾。</p>\n<h2>推薦整合包</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/shingeki-no-kyojin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>進擊的巨人 (Shingeki no Kyojin)</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>預覽圖 - 更多內容請查看圖庫！</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qtWRQmit/images/43f739dd35e197bbf20a9ce34e0a759fe5750fe5.png\" alt=\"大型箱子選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qtWRQmit/images/744bc834596c10843a2757b662eda504df9a11ae.png\" alt=\"鐵砧選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qtWRQmit/images/78b7185c018827f1ff8609a7e105371f317ee439.png\" alt=\"鍛造台選單\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 宣傳橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h3>資源包注意事項</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 創作者或內容創作者並使用本資源包，請在影片描述中附上連結指向此頁面，讓觀眾知道您使用的資源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳本資源包或其任何修改版本，此規定亦適用於轉發至其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得本人明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
